# Copy these into your host's environment variables (Railway: service, Variables). Never commit real values.

# --- Booking and contact emails (sent through Resend: https://resend.com) ---
# 1. Create an API key in Resend and paste it here.
RESEND_API_KEY=
# 2. Who is told about every new booking. Several addresses: separate them with commas.
LEAD_EMAIL_TO=hello@qilinlab.com
# 3. The sender. Verify the qilinlab.com domain in Resend first, or Resend only delivers to your own account.
LEAD_EMAIL_FROM="Qilin Lab <hello@qilinlab.com>"
# Set to "off" to stop the confirmation email that goes to the visitor.
LEAD_EMAIL_CONFIRMATION=on

# --- Optional: also forward each lead as JSON to a CRM, Zapier or Slack webhook ---
LEAD_WEBHOOK_URL=
